stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING
    PENDING --> LOADING: ctx.plugin()
    LOADING --> ACTIVE: 依赖就绪
    LOADING --> FAILED: 加载失败
    ACTIVE --> PENDING: 依赖缺失（休眠）
    PENDING --> ACTIVE: 依赖重新就绪
    ACTIVE --> UNLOADING: dispose() / epoch 变化
    UNLOADING --> ACTIVE: _reload() 级联重启
    UNLOADING --> DISPOSED: 逆序执行全部 disposer
    DISPOSED --> [*]
